# Permanent class grants and choices only. Context-dependent effects stay in rules text.
Elementalist Favored Class	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:FavoredClass	VISIBLE:DISPLAY	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL,1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Favored Class Bonus|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL
Elementalist Weave Energy	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresInternal	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Destruction Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_DESTRUCTION_CL_BONUS|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL-floor(SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL*3/4)	DESC:Destruction sphere uses Elementalist level instead of mid-caster level; class-granted sphere does not spend a talent choice.
Elementalist Combat Feats	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresInternal	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_COMBAT_FEATS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_COMBAT_FEATS|1+floor((SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL-2)/4)
Elementalist Favored Element Choices	CATEGORY:Special Ability	DESC:Choose a distinct Destruction blast type group at levels 3, 9 and 15. Its blasts deal +1/2 damage per Elementalist level, plus another +1/2 per level for each later favored element. Apply only to matching blasts.
Favored Element (Manual)	CATEGORY:Elementalist Favored Element	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:USERINPUT|1|TITLE=Destruction blast type group	DESC:Favored blast type group: %1. Apply group-specific bonus as described by Favored Element Choices; this is not a global damage modifier.|%LIST
Elementalist Dodge Bonus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_DODGE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_DODGE|floor(SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL/4)	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_DODGE|TYPE=Dodge	DESC:Dodge bonus to AC while eligible to receive dodge bonuses.
Elementalist Defense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_RESISTANCE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_RESISTANCE|5+5*floor((SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL-5)/6)	DESC:Resistance %1 to acid, cold, fire and electricity. Apply to incoming energy damage, not all damage.|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_RESISTANCE
Elementalist Movement Choices	CATEGORY:Special Ability	DESC:Choose a different elemental movement at levels 7, 13 and 19. Every chosen movement increases by 10 feet at levels 13 and 19.
Elementalist Swim	CATEGORY:Elementalist Movement	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_SWIM|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_SWIM|30+10*floor((SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL-7)/6)	DESC:Swim speed %1 ft.|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_SWIM
Elementalist Fly	CATEGORY:Elementalist Movement	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_FLY|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_FLY|20+10*floor((SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL-7)/6)	DESC:Fly speed %1 ft. (average maneuverability).|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_FLY
Elementalist Burrow	CATEGORY:Elementalist Movement	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_BURROW|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_BURROW|15+10*floor((SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL-7)/6)	DESC:Burrow speed %1 ft.|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_BURROW
Elementalist Land Speed	CATEGORY:Elementalist Movement	DEFINE:SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LAND|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LAND|20+10*floor((SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LEVEL-7)/6)	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE=Walk|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LAND	DESC:Increase base land speed by %1 ft.|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_LAND
Elementalist Energy Body	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_ELEMENTALIST_RESISTANCE|5	DR:10/magic	DESC:Immune to critical hits and sneak attacks. Acid, cold, fire and electricity resistance rises to 20; DR 10/magic.